From: Claudio DeSouza <cdesouza@brave.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Add the LICENSE file

crunchy 0.2.2 doesn't publish one, so gnrt can't write its README.chromium.
This is the MIT licence from https://github.com/eira-fransham/crunchy.

---
 third_party/rust/chromium_crates_io/vendor/crunchy-v0_2/LICENSE | 21 +++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 21 insertions(+)

diff --git a/brave/third_party/rust/chromium_crates_io/vendor/crunchy-v0_2/LICENSE b/brave/third_party/rust/chromium_crates_io/vendor/crunchy-v0_2/LICENSE
new file mode 100644
index 00000000000..635c0d97254
--- /dev/null
+++ b/brave/third_party/rust/chromium_crates_io/vendor/crunchy-v0_2/LICENSE
@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
